<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Abyssals — Trainer Portrait Corrections</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#14212b;color:#f0e9db;font:16px system-ui,sans-serif}header,main,footer{max-width:1300px;margin:auto;padding:24px}h1{font:clamp(30px,5vw,48px) Georgia,serif}p{line-height:1.6;color:#ccd2d4}.reference{display:flex;gap:28px;align-items:center;border:1px solid #566671;border-radius:8px;padding:16px;margin:24px 0}.reference img{width:150px;height:230px;object-fit:contain}.tools{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}button,select{font:inherit;padding:12px;border-radius:6px;background:#d6c18e;color:#192631;border:0;cursor:pointer}select{background:#344957;color:#fff}main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,320px),1fr));gap:18px}article{background:#223541;border:1px solid #526671;border-radius:8px;padding:16px}article[hidden]{display:none}h2{font:23px Georgia,serif;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 6px}.faction{font-size:13px;margin:0}.portrait{width:100%;height:390px;object-fit:contain;background:radial-gradient(#9ca5a9,#53636d);border-radius:5px;margin:12px 0}details{margin-top:24px}li{padding:5px 0}dialog{background:#293d4b;border:1px solid #889da8;color:#fff;padding:12px;max-width:96vw;border-radius:8px}dialog::backdrop{background:#000c}dialog img{display:block;width:min(84vw,800px);height:80vh;object-fit:contain}dialog button{display:block;margin:8px auto}@media(max-width:420px){.reference{gap:12px;padding:10px}.reference img{width:110px;height:210px}.portrait{height:360px}}</style></head><body><header><h1>Trainer portrait corrections</h1><p><b>49 corrected portraits · 20 awaiting redraw</b><br>Draft artwork review for the Abyssals trainer style correction. This review includes the completed battle portraits; the full game release is pending the remaining artwork.</p><div class="reference"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Established Abyssals trainer art style"><p><b>Established trainer style</b><br>Anime faces, adult proportions, clean illustrated shading and detailed medieval clothing. First Light and Dawn Bloom retain their distinct faction equipment.</p></div><div class="tools"><button id="compare" aria-pressed="false">Show original portraits</button><label>Company <select id="filter"><option>All trainers</option><option>First Light</option><option>Dawn Bloom</option></select></label><span id="status">Showing corrected portraits</span></div><details><summary>20 portraits still awaiting redraw</summary><ul><li>Path warden Margaret de Warenne</li><li>Path warden Richard de Warenne</li><li>Path warden Fatima bint Salim</li><li>Path warden Yusuf ibn Ali</li><li>Path warden Agnes de Beaumont</li><li>Path warden Matilda de Beaumont</li><li>Path warden Walter de Beaumont</li><li>Gate knight Aisha bint Umar</li><li>Bastion knight Khalid ibn Musa</li><li>Captain Yusuf ibn Ibrahim</li><li>Bloom knight Fatima bint Hasan</li><li>Relic knight Ahmad ibn Ali</li><li>Captain Zaynab bint Yusuf</li><li>Gate knight Musa ibn Salim</li><li>Scale-house knight Hafsa bint Ali</li><li>Civic captain Ibrahim ibn Ahmad</li><li>Dawn Bloom scout Ali ibn Salim</li><li>Dawn Bloom soldier Maryam bint Ahmad</li><li>Dawn Bloom soldier Hafsa bint Hasan</li><li>Dawn Bloom corporal Hasan ibn Yusuf</li></ul></details></header><main><article data-faction="First Light"><h2>Causeway scout Robert de Clare</h2><p class="faction">First Light</p><img class="portrait" src="data:image/webp;base64," data-original="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Causeway scout Robert de Clare corrected battle portrait"><button class="zoom" type="button">Enlarge portrait</button></article><article data-faction="Dawn Bloom"><h2>Caravan guard Ali ibn Umar</h2><p class="faction">Dawn Bloom</p><img class="portrait" src="data:image/webp;base64," data-original="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Caravan guard Ali ibn Umar c